          "headline": "Andhra orders evacuations as Cyclone Murasu nears landfall near Ongole tonight",
          "summary": "Severe cyclonic storm Murasu is expected to cross the south Andhra Pradesh coast near Ongole around midnight or in the early hours of Tuesday. The state has told officials to move people out of low-lying areas, and six NDRF and seven SDRF teams are on standby. Heavy to extremely heavy rain is forecast for coastal districts and Rayalaseema.",
          "why_it_matters": "Landfall tonight could damage homes, crops, power lines and ports along the east coast.",
