          "id": "india-gst-october-2026-11-01",
          "headline": "GST collections jump 23% to ₹2.31 lakh crore in October",
          "summary": "Gross GST collections rose about 23% from a year earlier to over ₹2.31 lakh crore in October, provisional government data show. Tax on imports jumped 42% to ₹72,246 crore, while domestic collections rose 15.8% to about ₹1.59 lakh crore. Net collections after refunds rose about 26% to over ₹2.03 lakh crore.",
          "why_it_matters": "Strong tax receipts give the government more room on spending and its deficit target.",
          "importance": 4,
          "lead": false,
          "verified": true,
          "note": null,
